0 BEGIN PGM CAMCRAFT MM
1 BLK FORM 0.1 Z X-20 Y-15 Z-2
2 BLK FORM 0.2 X+20 Y+15 Z+5
3 ; CONFIRM XYZ MODE - QUILL COUPLED - W FIXED
4 ; CONFIRM SPINDLE STOPPED - NO TILT
5 ; CANCEL ACTIVE COORDINATE TRANSFORMATIONS
6 ; CONFIRM QUILL AT UPPER CHANGE POSITION
7 ; VERIFY +Z RETRACT PATH AND CHANGE SPACE
8 ; CHECK FULL-RETRACT XY PATH FOR ALL TOOLS
9 ; VERIFY TOOL TABLE AND PRESET 2
10 ; CHECK PRESET X Y Z FILLED AND ROTATION ZERO
11 M0
12 CYCL DEF 247 DATUM SETTING ~
  Q339=+2
13 M137
14 ; OPERATION Arc contour
15 ; CHECK DRIVES OFF BEFORE TOUCHING TOOL
16 ; CHECK QUILL AT PHYSICAL CHANGE POSITION
17 ; ABORT IF EITHER CHECK FAILS
18 ; THEN INSTALL TOOL 2 FLAT-6
19 M0
20 TOOL CALL 2 Z S3500
21 L M140 MB MAX
22 ; CHECK ACTUAL TIP HEIGHT AND ENTIRE XY PATH
23 ; ABORT IF TOOL OR HOLDER CANNOT CLEAR
24 M0
25 M3
26 M9
27 L X+10 Y+0 R0 FMAX
28 L Z+10 R0 FMAX
29 L X+10 Y+0 Z+10 R0 FMAX
30 L X+10 Y+0 Z+4 R0 F120
31 CC X+0 Y+0
32 C X+0 Y+10 DR+ F350
33 CC X+0 Y+0
34 C X+10 Y+0 DR- F350
35 L X+15 Y+0 Z+4 R0 F220
36 L X+15 Y+0 Z+10 R0 FMAX
37 M9
38 M5
39 M2
40 END PGM CAMCRAFT MM
